<section class="currency-card mt-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Conversor de moedas</h2><p class="small text-secondary">Taxas de referência da Frankfurter. A conversão é indicativa e não altera os teus movimentos.</p><form id="currencyForm" class="row g-2 align-items-end"><div class="col-12 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="currencyAmount">Valor</label><input id="currencyAmount" class="form-control" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" value="1" required></div><div class="col-6 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="currencyFrom">De</label><select id="currencyFrom" class="form-select">@foreach(['EUR','USD','GBP','BRL'] as $c)<option @selected($c===$moeda)>{{ $c }}</option>@endforeach</select></div><div class="col-6 col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="currencyTo">Para</label><select id="currencyTo" class="form-select">@foreach(['EUR','USD','GBP','BRL'] as $c)<option @selected($c==='USD')>{{ $c }}</option>@endforeach</select></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3 d-grid"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Converter</button></div></form><p id="currencyResult" class="conversion-result mt-3 mb-0" aria-live="polite">Introduz um valor e seleciona as moedas.</p></section>
